Tess: Quick SEO handoff for the upcoming webinar landing (launch in 30h). Need: hero keywords, FAQ longtails, JSON-LD, redirects for legacy promos, and anchor text table.
Ravi: I got keywords + hero. Proposing primary: 'LLM inference production', 'low-latency LLM serving'. Support: 'inference batching', 'KV cache strategies', 'model routing patterns'. Hero H1: 'Low-Latency LLM Inference for Production'.
Noah: I'll own redirects + canonical. Legacy routes: /promo/2025-edge and /events/edge-demo -> 301 to /webinars/serving-llms-2026. No JS/meta-refresh.
Noah: nginx snippet (to paste in infra PR):
```
location = /promo/2025-edge {
  return 301 /webinars/serving-llms-2026;
}
location = /events/edge-demo {
  return 301 /webinars/serving-llms-2026;
}
```
Tess: Anchor text recommendations: Blog -> 'real-world LLM latency', Benchmarks -> 'throughput benchmarks', Docs -> 'integration guide', Footer -> 'webinar: Serving LLMs'. Keep anchors natural, avoid keyword-stuffing.
Ravi: JSON-LD Event to include in head (paste exact string in CMS):
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Redwood Inference Webinar: Serving LLMs","startDate":"2026-06-26T18:00:00Z","location":{"@type":"VirtualLocation","url":"https://redwood.ai/webinars/serving-llms-2026"},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Redwood Inference"}}
seo-bot: crawl-scan: 6 related promo pages missing Event schema; flagged duplicates in titles. Recommend adding JSON-LD and unify titles.
Tess: Action list: Ravi -> upload hero + FAQ longtails to CMS; Noah -> open infra PR with redirects and add canonical headers; I'll update anchor table and UTM spec and share with sales. Can everyone post a status update here when done? :thumbsup:
